  "releaseNotes": "- Performance Optimization: Enhanced memory overlapping detection in FastCopy using modern Span-based intrinsic methods.\n      - Architectural Refinement: Implemented strict coding style standards and updated XML documentation for all core APIs.\n      - Network Efficiency: Removed legacy error-code overhead from high-speed transport layers to achieve maximum throughput.\n      - Naming Standardization: Standardized variable naming conventions (s_ for static, _ for private) for global maintainability.\n      - New Validation Engine: Integrated \"LuciferGuard\" to decouple validation logic, ensuring cleaner and more reliable code.\n      - WebSocket Refactoring: Optimized synchronous send paths and unified frame-building logic to eliminate code duplication and maximize speed.",
